  "no_overclaim": "R-085 proves a conditional nonorthogonal weighted Schur implication, not the production Cartan atom estimate or controlled Cartan CFAR. It form-absorbs exactly five unshifted rational families only for the regular orthogonal strict-past one-shot class; the signed shifted-Hessian pair remains coupled to its positive square and unproved. Complete signed NEAR, REG, OVERLAP, CORE, one-use, Nelson, a measure theorem, and Sector-A closure remain open.",
